  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate financing and aid effectiveness</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Klimatfinansiering och bist&#xe5;ndseffektivitet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet st&#xf6;ds tillsammans med UNDP, ADB, OECD, JICA och CDDE med syfte att ta fram rekommendationer p&#xe5; hur klimatfinansiering ska hanteras mer effektivt p&#xe5; landniv&#xe5;. Sex pilotl&#xe4;nder har valts ut f&#xf6;r djupare landstudier: Bangladesh, Kambodja, Indonesia, Filippinerna, Vietnam och Nepal. Programmet inleddes maj 2010 och f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas p&#xe5;g&#xe5; i ca 1 &#xe5;r.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme is a collaboration with UNDP, ADB, OECD, JICA and CDDE with a view to generate findings as to how climate change finance can be managed more effectively at the country level. Six pilot countries have been selected for country studies: Bangladesh, Cambodia, Indonesia, Philippines, Vietnam and Nepal. The programme was initiated in May 2010 and is expected to be finalized within one year</narrative>
  </description>
